<p>An approved claim can still leave you short. A San Marcos homeowner gets a check after a hailstorm, calls three roofers, and finds every bid is well above what the insurer paid. A business owner receives a settlement that leaves out the rooftop units and half the interior. An <strong>underpaid insurance claim in San Marcos</strong> usually has specific, identifiable causes: missed damage, low quantities, unrealistic pricing, or deductions that were never clearly explained. As a San Marcos public adjuster, we review the insurer's estimate against the actual damage and help you decide whether there is a documented basis to ask for more.</p>

